   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 223,
   "en": "Steel Dragons",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 224,
   "en": "Aboard the Hagane",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 225,
   "en": "First the Ares Geist, and now remnants of@the <Dark Brain> show up?@What the hell is going on?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 226,
   "en": "The Crystal Dragoon that Major Kai and Kota's group@fought in Hokkaido apparently didn't come out@of the Cross Gate.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 227,
   "en": "Crystal Dragoon... Is that a code name?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 228,
   "en": "No, apparently that's its actual name.@And they say it really looks like a crystal dragon.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 229,
   "en": "Why's something like that showing up now?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 230,
   "en": "Right. It wasn't in the final battle back then.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 231,
   "en": "Sorry to cut in, but...@what is this Dark Brain?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 232,
   "en": "Huh, you don't know?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "No. I left the military after the <L5 Campaign>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "Ryusei, the Federation government hasn't announced@its existence like with the <Einst> or <Shura>,@so of course she doesn't know.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "Oh, right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "(Though I guess civilians don't know much@about the Einst or Shura either.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "The Dark Brain is an emperor of darkness who came@out of another dimension in the final battle of the@<Shura Revolt>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "An emperor of darkness... That's pretty blunt.@And I suppose his goal is to rule the whole universe?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "Oh, that's pretty much right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "(Jeez, I meant that as a joke.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "To be more precise, it's a collective of the negative@thoughts of intelligent life, with an Kaimei Brain,@a super high-performance autonomous spirit computer.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "Tenia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "Umm... I don't get it at all.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "Then how about a big evil robot emperor@with a computer shaped like a brain?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Yeah, that I get.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "You said final battle.@Don't tell me you people were the ones@who beat the <Dark Brain>?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "Yeah... It was one hell of a fight.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "Back then, under those conditions, maybe the Dark@Brain was the only one capable of dimensional transfer.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "It didn't seem like he opened the gate@to our world all that easily, either.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "So the others wanted to follow him,@but couldn't?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "...Do the Dark Brain's servants include@others besides the Crystal Dragoon?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "Pretty likely, don't you think?@An evil emperor always comes with an evil army.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "So what are they coming to Earth now to do?@Avenge their boss?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "Maybe, if they went straight@for the G-Compatible Kaiser.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "G-Compati... What's that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "A super robot built to fight the Dark Brain.@For various reasons, a guy named Kota@pilots it now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "Kota and Shoko might be@at Izu too. It might be best@to ask them for the details.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "Hm? Orders just came in.@Pilots are to wait in their cockpits immediately.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "It's true... And we're about to enter the atmosphere.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "It's to prepare for the unexpected.@Come on, let's go, everyone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "Yes, sir.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "(The unexpected, huh...@As far as I'm concerned, it's about time@those guys showed up.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "Hagane: Bridge",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "Miles",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "...I'm still not convinced, Captain.@Izu Base may have been attacked twice, but we're@unlikely to meet the enemy after we descend.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "The enemy uses transfer tactics, yet hasn't@done decisive damage to the base.@So I believe they have another objective.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "Which is why I asked you earlier what that was.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "My answer is the same... Unknown. However, I believe@this ship's return would be inconvenient for an@enemy targeting Izu.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "So isn't it rash to assume they'll interfere or attack?@The pilots are worn out from the string of@battles lately, you know.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Eita",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "(Nagging about something he already approved...@It's not the cockpit standby, he just didn't like@the captain arguing back for once.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Then if nothing happens, consider it my error@in judgment, and discipline me accordingly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "Hmph, very well.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Tetsuya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "(Unlike usual, the captain didn't back down right@away. Does that mean he's certain?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "XO, begin the atmospheric entry sequence.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "Sir, beginning the atmospheric entry sequence.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Captain. Descent sequence complete.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Mm.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Well? Are there any enemies lying in wait?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "No, nothing on radar.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "Commander, I'd like to go into <TD Hovering> at this@altitude and set Level 1 battle stations for all hands@before heading to Izu. Is that acceptable?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Hmph, you don't give up, do you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "It's a precaution.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "We descended to Earth without incident.@Shouldn't we return as soon as possible?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Contact on radar!@Unknowns approaching! Straight in from 11 o'clock,@underwater!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Wh-What?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "All hands, level-one battle stations!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Unknowns surfacing as they close in!@Entering Range 3!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Azuki",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "No response to our warnings!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "How long until the unknowns break the surface?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "If they keep their current rate of ascent,@about 120 seconds!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "XO, prepare an <Asroc> attack.@After firing, launch all mobile units.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "Understood. Preparing Asroc attack.@After firing, launching all units.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Unknowns identified!@They're <Zovorg> mobile weapons!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "(Hm, ngh... So the captain's read was right...!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "Targets breaking the surface!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "What, they're nothing but <Urchin>s.@They really think they can beat us with those?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Probably a decoy to hold us in place.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "Then the real deal's hiding somewhere.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "(If it's the Zovorg,@that one might show up...!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "XO, have the mobile units intercept the enemy.@This ship will stay in <TD Hovering> here for@a while and see how the enemy moves.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "Keep an all-around alert,@in case enemy reinforcements transfer in.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Understood. Mobile units, intercept the enemy.@This ship will TD Hover here on all-around alert.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "Are they running away?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "They're trying to lure us in.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "An obvious diversion.@The real force may be underwater,@closer than we'd expect.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "Shall we probe for them?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Commander, I'll send out a recon <USV>.@Is that acceptable?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "I don't mind, but our real mission is...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "To return to Izu Base as soon as possible. Since the@enemy's intent is unclear, I agree. This ship will@focus on destroying the enemies in this area.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Y-Yes. That's the best answer, Captain.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "All enemy signals in the area are gone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "Bring all units back.@We'll return to Izu Base while maintaining@all-around alert.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Japan - Off Kozu Island",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "XO, I'll be returning to the commander's office.@Contact me when we reach Izu Base.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "...Your read was right, Captain.@Because you insisted the pilots wait in their@cockpits, we were able to respond quickly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "XO, the commander's doubts and points are valid.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "Huh? But...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "What we need to focus on now is what@the ones who attacked Izu are after.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "What's more, they're not our only enemy.@The fighting will likely intensify from here.@It may become like <The Sealing War>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "That's why we of the Steel Dragons must fight@the enemy as one, under Commander Miles.@Take that to heart.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "Understood...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  }
 ]
}